<http://example.org/clo/ontology/clo#ownedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The team accountable for a resource. Asserted from the inventory or a CMDB. One owning team is expected; several are reported by the closed-world rule I-27 rather than declared functional (no unique-name assumption in OWL)."@en .
<http://example.org/clo/ontology/clo#ownedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "owned by"@en .
<http://example.org/clo/ontology/clo#ownedBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
