<http://example.org/clo/ontology/clo#LabelVocabulary> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Controlled vocabulary defining the allowed values for a LabelKey. Aligned with skos:ConceptScheme. E.g.: vocabulary of environment = {dev, staging, prod, sandbox}. Basis of inferences I-09 (out-of-vocabulary value) and I-20 (correction by Levenshtein distance)."@en .
