<http://example.org/clo/ontology/clo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "OWL 2 DL profile (checked with ROBOT validate-profile). Outside OWL 2 RL because of 9 axioms: 3 exact cardinalities (ResourceType, Label), the union domain of governedBy and 5 definitions (LabeledResource, UnlabeledResource, ConflictingResource, FullyCompliantResource, AuditableResource). Tested with HermiT 1.3.8 via owlready2 0.51."@en .
<http://example.org/clo/ontology/clo> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0> .
<http://example.org/clo/ontology/clo> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/title> "CloudLabelOntology (CLO)" .
<http://example.org/clo/ontology/clo> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> "OWL 2 DL ontology for the audit, recommendation and repair of labels (tags) on multi-provider cloud resources. Covers 11 providers and 13 functional categories; the BaseKind pivot supports cross-provider inference without external pattern matching. Version 8: inferences I-03/I-04/I-05 made operative, resource-type catalogue in a separate file (clo_types.ttl)." .
<http://example.org/clo/ontology/clo> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date> "2026" .
<http://example.org/clo/ontology/clo> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> "Anonymous (under double-blind review)" .
<http://example.org/clo/ontology/clo> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
